@base = http://localhost:5256

### Get Wallet
GET {{base}}/api/wallets/6
Accept: application/json

### topup
POST {{base}}/api/wallets/6/topups
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "paymentMethodId" : 2,
    "amount" : 12000
}

### Get Topup
GET {{base}}/api/wallets//topups/detail
Accept: application/json


### confirm pembayaran
PATCH {{base}}/api/wallets/5/topups/confirm
Accept: application/json
